MID_MV11_07: <SH>
MID_MV11_07_m001: (cheering)
MID_MV11_07_m002: Fourteen centuries have passed now since the\nfounding of our mighty Dagdan Empire.
MID_MV11_07_m003: And I can proudly declare to the world that throughout\nour long and storied history, we have thrived.
MID_MV11_07_m004: (derisive giggle)
MID_MV11_07_m005: We owe this prosperity to the priests that serve in\nour temples. To the soldiers that keep the peace.\nAnd most of all...
MID_MV11_07_m006: We owe it to you, our brave and noble citizens.
MID_MV11_07_m007: Bold warriors! Draw now upon your strength.\nHold fast to the devotion in your beating hearts.
MID_MV11_07_m008: For those who stand upon the final stage...
MID_MV11_07_m009: I shall grant whatever wish you may desire.\nSo say I, the Divine Sovereign.
MID_MV11_07_m010: That, I vow to you.
MID_MV11_07_m011: People of Dagsion! Hear me now as I declare\nthat the Heroic Games...have begun!
MID_MV11_07_m012: (cheering)
MID_MV11_07_m013: Our gracious Divine Sovereign...
MID_MV11_07_m014: presents for us a very special exhibition match.\nA perfect start to these most sacred games!
MID_MV11_07_m015: Warriors, enter the arena!
MID_MV11_07_m016: (cheering)
MID_MV11_07_m017: Emerging today from the eastern gate,\na man I'm sure you all recognize.
MID_MV11_07_m018: Dagsion's living legend, the White-Maned Demon!
MID_MV11_07_m019: (cheering)
MID_MV11_07_m020: It's him. It's—
MID_MV11_07_m021: He's so handsome...
MID_MV11_07_m022: (Gasp)
MID_MV11_07_m023: Bertrand...you are alive.
MID_MV11_07_m024: (displeased breath)
MID_MV11_07_m025: And from the western gate...
MID_MV11_07_m026: an assassin forged in the fires of Brezarant.\nA warrior shrouded in mystery!
MID_MV11_07_m027: Cruaidín!
MID_MV11_07_m028: (murmurs of confusion)
MID_MV11_07_m029: Who's that?
MID_MV11_07_m030: Never heard of that guy...
MID_MV11_07_m031: I mean, sure, he's big, but the\nWhite-Maned Demon is a legend.
MID_MV11_07_m032: They must be running out of challengers!
MID_MV11_07_m033: (sharp breath)
MID_MV11_07_m034: (sharp breath)
MID_MV11_07_m035: (attack exert)
MID_MV11_07_m036: (shouts of excitement)
MID_MV11_07_m037: He's strong! SO strong!
MID_MV11_07_m038: WHOA!
MID_MV11_07_m039: Stalwart warriors!
MID_MV11_07_m040: Bless this colosseum with a fight worthy of\nopening the games. Let the battles begin!